<title>JAPAN: Kitazawa Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kitazawa Sangyo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 10.64		vs	   10.12</p>
<p> Operating	  419    million	  vs	  321    million</p>
<p> Current	    421    million	  vs	  339    million</p>
<p> Net		  136    million	  vs	  126    million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.51 yen	  vs	    6.29 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kitazawa Sangyo Co Ltd is a major seller of commercial-use kitchen equipment.</p>
